title Panels
align center
col
  w 100%
  maxw 520
  pad 20
  gap 12
  fnt 22
  fg 235 240 255
  txt Panels
  fnt 14
  fg 190 205 230
  tab One, Two, Three
    col
      pad 10
      txt The first panel. It is short.
    end
    col
      pad 10
      gap 6
      txt The second panel is taller.
      txt It has three lines.
      txt So the page below it moves down.
    end
    col
      pad 10
      btn A button in panel three 1
    end
  end
  acc More details
    col
      pad 10
      gap 6
      txt An accordion keeps its body closed until its header is clicked.
      txt Opening it lays the page out again.
    end
  end
  txt Below the panels.
  lnk Back to the start page home
  dlg Welcome
    txt This dialog sits over the page. Only it takes clicks until it is closed.
    btn Fine 9
  end
end
